; Rescued, not a starter: the Emberdeep's chapter wizard, freed at the great anvil (.ai/chapter-wizards.md
; 4.7). The master smith of the Germanic tales, who struck every chain in this game and was chained to his
; own anvil with them. His passive is Wings - the wings he made to get off the king's island, the one axis
; no other wizard owns: the ground under his feet. He flies when he moves (roster.wayland, anim_sets.flight),
; so floor traps never touch him and water never slows him (Player.Wings.cs); it was +10% move speed until
; 2026-11-09. Collision is unchanged: his Feet collider meets walls and blocking ground as everyone's does.
